        "author": "Aung Moe Khine",
        "maintainer": "Aung Moe Khine <aungmoekhine@gmail.com>",
        "sentence": "Universal standalone TFT, touch, sprite, hardware terminal, onboard audio, battery telemetry, 80MHz SPI stress test & tear-free raster animation driver with 1-line autoSetup and adaptive autoCalibrate for ESP32/S3 CYD resistive & capacitive boards and ESP32-S3 RGB capacitive boards.",
        "paragraph": "Bundles high-speed display and touch drivers with runtime hardware auto-probing for 2.4\", 2.8\", 3.2\", 3.5\", and 4.0\" CYD resistive and capacitive boards (ILI9341, ST7789, ST7796, GC9307, XPT2046, GT911, CST820, FT6336, CHSC6540) including ESP32-S3 SPI displays (VIEWE UEDX24320028, ES3C28P) and ESP32-S3 parallel RGB boards (4.3\", 5.0\", 7.0\" 800x480 ST7262 + GT911 capacitive touch). Features certified 80 MHz SPI bus stress testing with NVS persistence (tft.stressTest()), unbuffered tear-free Raster Animation with zero framebuffer, hardware scanline Beam Chasing (command 0x45), panel refresh rate tuning (tft.applyRefreshChoice(), tft.setRefreshStep()), ultra-fast AMK_Terminal (5 KB RAM hardware-scrolling text console), onboard PAM8302 audio amplifier enable & pop-free tone generation (tft.enableAudio(), tft.playBeep()), calibrated ADC battery telemetry (tft.getBatteryVoltage(), tft.getBatteryPercentage()), 1-line universal SD card mounting (tft.initSD()), 1-line hardware auto-setup (tft.autoSetup()), adaptive multi-point statistical touch calibration with NVS persistence (tft.autoCalibrate()), ambient light auto-dimming with LDR moving average filtering (tft.adjustBrightness()), universal Active-LOW RGB LED control, persistent NVS hardware overrides, full TFT_eSPI and TFT_eSPI_Button compatibility, linear gradients, alpha blending, TFT_eSprite buffering, LVGL v8/v9 integration, and seamless SquareLine Studio / EEZ Studio support.",
        "category": "Display",
        "architectures": [
          "*"
        ],
